# Lactase and milk: one enzyme fits one substrate
#
# Three equal milk samples share one clock. Only the sample with lactase
# hydrolyses milk sugar; no enzyme and the wrong enzyme are fair controls.
register lv1

add v1 whole_milk 20g
add v1 lactase 0.1g

new beaker
add v2 whole_milk 20g

new beaker
add v3 whole_milk 20g
add v3 lipase 0.1g

wait 1h
look v1
look v2
look v3

# The bench records bounded bond cleavage inside the conserved milk solids.
# It does not claim sweetness or named glucose and galactose inventories.
